correctIndex:0,
explanation:"The demonstration method gives students a clear visual model of correct technique to observe and imitate, leveraging observational learning before and during practice.",
concept:{title:"Demonstration Method",definition:"One of the oldest and most widely used teaching methods for motor-skill acquisition.",points:["Provides a visual, observable model of correct technique","Most effective when followed immediately by guided practice","Can be delivered live by the teacher or via video"],memoryTrick:"'Demonstrate = show it, THEN let them try it.'",sportsRelevance:"Standard first step for teaching any new sport skill, from a basketball free-throw to a swimming stroke."},
